# Error

**Error:** failed to resolve component from path: must specify a component directory, not the base directory

Cannot resolve component: path points to component base directory Path: /absolute/path/to/repo/tests/fixtures/scenarios/complete/components/terraform Component base: /absolute/path/to/repo/tests/fixtures/scenarios/complete/components/terraform

💡 Navigate into a specific component directory Example: cd terraform/vpc && atmos terraform plan . --stack <stack>

